{"id":"9a591370db4d4b2b","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-np-complete-language-in-p.md","title":"一个 NP 完备语言的多项式判定即可决定 P=NP","display":"thm-np-complete-language-in-p — 一个 NP 完备语言的多项式判定即可决定 P=NP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-np-complete-language-in-p","aliases":["73-thm-np-complete-language-in-p"],"display":"thm-np-complete-language-in-p — 一个 NP 完备语言的多项式判定即可决定 P=NP","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-p]]","[[73-df-binary-np]]","[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§13.1, pp. 322–324; scans 330–332","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-np-complete-language-in-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-np-complete-language-in-p</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-np-complete-language-in-p — 一个 NP 完备语言的多项式判定即可决定 P=NP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.1, print pp. 425–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.1, pp. 322–324; scans 330–332"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}\\)</span>，相关类与归约见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}np\\text{-}complete\\text{-}language\\text{-}in\\text{-}p}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathsf P\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf P=\\mathsf{NP}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}np\\text{-}complete\\text{-}language\\text{-}in\\text{-}p}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathsf P\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf P=\\mathsf{NP}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 A 有多项式判定器，任意 NP 语言先执行到 A 的多项式归约，再执行该判定器即属于 P。反向直接由 A∈NP 得到。不把这个等价式当作已经回答了 P=NP。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"69f4f24da36d1d66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}$，相关类与归约见 [[73-df-binary-p]]、[[73-df-binary-np]]、[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]、[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"